i's hostage. After Guo Si was killed and Li Jue absorbed his forces, Lady Li had already disappeared without a trace.","jp":"董卓の旧配下・李傕の娘。董卓の遷都に伴い、家族とともに長安へと移り住んだ。しかし董卓の死後、郭汜と李傕の対立が勃発し、李氏は郭汜の人質となってしまう。郭汜が殺害された後、李傕は郭汜の旧配下を傘下に収めたが、李氏はすでに消息を絶っていた。","kr":"동탁의 옛 부하 이각의 딸. 동탁이 천도한 후 가족을 따라 장안에 정착했으나, 동탁 사후 곽사와 이각의 갈등이 폭발하며 곽사의 인질이 되었다. 곽사가 살해당한 뒤 이각이 곽사의 옛 부하들을 거두었으나, 이씨의 행방은 이미 묘연해진 뒤였다."},"notRecommended":{"type":"0","year":"999","reason":{"zh":"","tc":"","en":"","jp":"","kr":""}},"raw":{"userIndex":"15","id":"WJ1014502","remark":"","surname":"李","surnameTc":"李","surnameEn":"Li","surnameJp":"李","surnameKr":"이","surnameOther":"","name":"婉","nameTc":"婉","nameEn":"Wan","nameJp":"婉","nameKr":"완","nameOther":"","word":"","wordTc":"","wordEn":"","wordJp":"","wordKr":"","wordOther":"","icon":"李婉","power":"","rejectPower":"","rejectDuration":"0","ignoreUnRecruit":"0","ignoreUnSelectable":"0","unSelectable":"0","recruit":"1","travel":"0","state":"2","workYear":"194","city":"CS1030","gender":"1","rule":"72","force":"73","wise":"68","politics":"51","charm":"69","will":"70","ruleTalent":"8","forceTalent":"8","wiseTalent":"7","politicsTalent":"4","charmTalent":"7","willTalent":"8","weaponMaster":"79/29/29/29/29/68/22/29","battleAttribute":"1/1/1/1/1/1/1/1","debateAttribute":"1/1/1","warSkill":"","battleSkill":"","debateCard":"","warSoul":"","battleSoul":"","debateSoul":"","warSoulPoint":"5100","battleSoulPoint":"5300","debateSoulPoint":"4600","strategy":"1000308","strategy2":"1008401","professions":"0/0/4/0/0/0/2/0/1/0/1/2/0/1/2/0/2/0/0/0/3/2/0/1","attribute2":"74/78/68/51/70/72","morality":"2","compatible":"5","loyalty":"100","reputation":"0","evaluate":"0","title":"","rank":"9","birth":"172","show":"184","death":"229","age":"0","injury":"","deathReason":"0","type":"0","npcTag":"0","npcNum":"1","microScene":"0","isImportant":"0","speaking":"4","weapon":"WP15004","armor":"WP1001202","helmet":"WP1012902","treasure":"","horse":"","shield":"","character":"1/1;2/1;7/1;13/1;37/1;63/1;36/0